WEBVTT


00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.960
Trading isn't just a skill.

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:04.120
It's a path to total freedom.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.220
You're learning how to make money without begging anyone,

00:00:07.221 --> 00:00:08.621
without waiting for permission,

00:00:08.622 --> 00:00:11.121
without limits. That's power.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.020
Most people don't understand what you're doing.

00:00:14.021 --> 00:00:16.681
That's fine. They're not supposed to.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:22.080
They'll call it risky, unrealistic or luck until they see your results.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.460
Keep your head down. Keep studying,

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:27.701
keep executing. The day will come when you wake up,

00:00:27.702 --> 00:00:31.721
open your laptop and realise you never have to clock in again.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.320
You're not chasing trades.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.044
You're building the life most people only dream of. And you're.
